            {
                "entry_id": "779b6099-12d5-3f3f-824a-d1c8c08e05cc",
                "word": "combo",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "f2389da0-9c94-45de-a020-6aa642d63cd3",
                        "entry_id": "779b6099-12d5-3f3f-824a-d1c8c08e05cc",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "combos"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "fb513820-865b-47c7-baae-1e2d86e07442",
                        "entry_id": "779b6099-12d5-3f3f-824a-d1c8c08e05cc",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "comboes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5aba7015-749c-3ee7-aaf0-823437f35ee3",
                        "entry_id": "779b6099-12d5-3f3f-824a-d1c8c08e05cc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A small musical group."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8d248557-54a9-4323-9c1d-fe3720a2cd15",
                                "sense_id": "5aba7015-749c-3ee7-aaf0-823437f35ee3",
                                "text": "The jazz combo played nightly at the little restaurant."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8e50bb86-74fc-3f58-9c6f-5da85ef5b428",
                        "entry_id": "779b6099-12d5-3f3f-824a-d1c8c08e05cc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A combination."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e5791634-e07f-4af3-b335-47e30cd3ebe9",
                                "sense_id": "8e50bb86-74fc-3f58-9c6f-5da85ef5b428",
                                "text": "I need to open the safe but I forgot the combo."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "07e51fe0-629b-44b2-9ac2-c76f49af7fec",
                                "sense_id": "8e50bb86-74fc-3f58-9c6f-5da85ef5b428",
                                "text": "I order the low priced combo platter: a taco, a burrito and a chimichanga."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b73dd066-ac89-4d0a-966f-b99a372f8e94",
                                "sense_id": "8e50bb86-74fc-3f58-9c6f-5da85ef5b428",
                                "text": "As the 1857 to Manchester Piccadilly rolls in, I scan the windows and realise there are plenty of spare seats, so I hop aboard. The train is a '221'+'220' combo to allow for social distancing - a luxury on an XC train as normally you're playing sardines, so I make the most of it."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b7ac5f69-35bb-31d3-9135-58168ea1c8c6",
                        "entry_id": "779b6099-12d5-3f3f-824a-d1c8c08e05cc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Effective combination of gameplay elements.",
                            "An action composed of a sequence of simpler actions, especially a composite attacking move in a fighting game."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "24a2e697-ab4c-4619-a309-cd7be17a9501",
                                "sense_id": "b7ac5f69-35bb-31d3-9135-58168ea1c8c6",
                                "text": "Obviously, this is something not seen very often, with super flashy, combo-driven fighters dominating store shelves everywhere."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "226590ee-7459-392f-b665-7929067ddb08",
                        "entry_id": "779b6099-12d5-3f3f-824a-d1c8c08e05cc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Effective combination of gameplay elements.",
                            "Two or more gameplay elements (e.g. characters, items) which are powerful when used together."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2451b4f7-537b-4501-94f6-2b14dcf7f4c8",
                                "sense_id": "226590ee-7459-392f-b665-7929067ddb08",
                                "text": "Tm have several OP combos, i think ecology expert with kelp algea^([sic]) is stronger than fish combo IMO."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8fd2e633-20b1-33b2-b45f-235e62618075",
                        "entry_id": "779b6099-12d5-3f3f-824a-d1c8c08e05cc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Effective combination of gameplay elements.",
                            "A strategy aiming to win by playing a specific combination of cards (or similar), often in a single turn."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "51f2528a-be03-4673-9a82-4fcca024fdc6",
                                "sense_id": "8fd2e633-20b1-33b2-b45f-235e62618075",
                                "text": "Personally I'd like to see an environment where all the major archetypes, control, beatdown, and combo are viable."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f8c4fd61-0890-471b-8e56-2a2884268a8c",
                                "sense_id": "8fd2e633-20b1-33b2-b45f-235e62618075",
                                "text": "Whenever I play (I play D&D alot^([sic]) too) I always play combo."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "746705a6-eef3-3751-8352-c636b6226f97",
                        "entry_id": "779b6099-12d5-3f3f-824a-d1c8c08e05cc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A Caucasian man who marries or has a sexual relationship with an Aboriginal woman, or who lives among Aboriginal people and adopts Aboriginal culture."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Australia",
                            "derogatory"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3993a528-610e-4c2a-9c0e-06f6d0a573c8",
                                "sense_id": "746705a6-eef3-3751-8352-c636b6226f97",
                                "text": "\"[…] Look at Ganger O'Cannon of Black Adder Creek, with his halfcaste wife and quadroon kids, a down-right family man—yet looked on as as much a combo as if he lived in a blacks' camp. Isn't that so? […] The casual comboes are respected, while men like O'Cannon and myself, who rear their kids, are utterly despised. […]\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "131e8bef-8b85-4f46-8c1d-a15e41cc1988",
                                "sense_id": "746705a6-eef3-3751-8352-c636b6226f97",
                                "text": "1993, Journal of the Australian Institute of Aboriginal Studies, p. 97, https://books.google.ca/books?id=Ky4iAQAAMAAJ&q=%22a+combo%22+halfcaste+-%22combo+box%22&dq=%22a+combo%22+halfcaste+-%22combo+box%22&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwi18NvhnufMAhWL6IMKHfnYDUkQ6AEIbDAQ\nIf he sides with the Aborigines against their employers and exploiters, he may be called a ' combo ', and yet he may not achieve popularity with the Aborigines."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e5052934-d166-488c-83e5-4416e87779ab",
                                "sense_id": "746705a6-eef3-3751-8352-c636b6226f97",
                                "text": "Many passages in Harney's books are written from the point of view of what he refers to as the ' combo '; a white man who has sexual relations with Aboriginal women. The combo is seen as an anarchic, egalitarian figure whose enjoyment of life largely comes through his pursuit of Aboriginal women."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b9ebd8b1-1763-3066-bcb6-fc27904b4cb4",
                        "entry_id": "779b6099-12d5-3f3f-824a-d1c8c08e05cc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A combo box."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d95da0e-844d-43c8-a9a9-d62c158f1654",
                                "sense_id": "b9ebd8b1-1763-3066-bcb6-fc27904b4cb4",
                                "text": "Combos and lists are two very powerful controls that allow the user to select from a predetermined set of values."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
